        },
        {
            "_id": "tfzICAl5Hwqghj3K",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg",
            "name": "Beat Down",
            "sort": 600000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 2
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>Baulrica makes two fist Strikes against a single target. Both Strikes count toward Baulrica's multiple attack penalty, but the penalty doesn't increase until after both attacks. If she hits with both Strikes, the target must also succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:30|options:inflicts:prone] save or be knocked @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone].</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
                "slug": null,
                "traits": {
                    "value": []
                }
            },
            "type": "action"
        },
        {
            "_id": "OM7bmhK1xbGohrIh",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg",
            "name": "Eye Gouge",
            "sort": 700000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 1
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>If Baulrica's last action was a successful fist Strike against a creature, Baulrica jabs her fingers into that creature's eyes. The creature attempts a @Check[fortitude|dc:30|options:inflicts:blinded,inflicts:persistent-damage] save. On a failed save, the creature takes @Damage[2d6[persistent,bleed]] damage. On a critical failure, the creature is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Blinded] for as long as the persistent damage lasts.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
                "slug": null,
                "traits": {
                    "value": []
                }
            },
            "type": "action"
        }
